+## Marin Snowball performance deployment
+
+This internal deployment uses the same read APIs and transforms as InferenceX.
+Its build supplies `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`; resolve API paths against that origin.
+IAP protects the web service and its APIs. The web database role has SELECT only.
+
+The landing URL selects `/inference/marin-snowball-v011` with
+`i_seq=agentic-traces&i_prec=bf16&i_metric=y_outputTputPerGpu&i_pctl=p90`.
+Use `/api/v1/benchmarks?model=Marin-Snowball-67B-A2B-v0.1.1` for raw points and
+the existing inference/history views for the matching displayed projection.
+Device selection uses the existing hardware controls. Select a point to inspect
+its concurrency, request timeline and GitHub source run; sibling navigation
+selects the other measured concurrency points. Missing measurements stay absent.
+Per-point distributions preserve the first profiling request at the stage boundary.
+Report the selected stage and its request count; the stored timeline also includes
+warmup records, while throughput and latency summaries use upstream profiling aggregates.
+
+The benchmark artifact manifest records the fixed model/tokenizer and corpus
+revisions, harness, vLLM wheel/source, serving recipe, actual Iris attempt and
+GPU topology. A different model checkpoint starts a separate comparison series.
+Cloud Run activation and benchmark collection are managed in Marin's
+`infra/inferencex/` and `experiments/evaluation/agentx/` runbooks.
